1
00:00:00,460 --> 00:00:02,000
First it was Soda-kun.

2
00:00:02,080 --> 00:00:06,210
And now Tsubasa-kun got a yellow card for arguing with the referee.

3
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:08,840
It seems he made a harsh decision.

4
00:00:08,920 --> 00:00:09,970
Tsubasa!

5
00:00:10,260 --> 00:00:12,740
Who are you to protest the referee's decision?

6
00:00:13,090 --> 00:00:14,890
Oh, no...

7
00:00:15,810 --> 00:00:17,810
Just listen to the shouts.

8
00:00:17,890 --> 00:00:21,480
I'm not surprised the home crowd supports the referee.

9
00:00:24,230 --> 00:00:25,270
Tsubasa!

10
00:00:26,770 --> 00:00:27,780
Tsubasa...

11
00:00:28,190 --> 00:00:32,240
If you get sent off too, everything will be over.

12
00:00:32,820 --> 00:00:34,010
Soda!

13
00:00:34,320 --> 00:00:38,010
Now Japan has to continue the match with 10 men.

14
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:41,020
I can't imagine how Soda-kun is feeling right now.

15
00:00:41,040 --> 00:00:44,130
And on top of that, France has now won a penalty.

16
00:00:57,850 --> 00:01:02,790
CAPTAIN TSUBASA: JUNIOR YOUTH ARC

17
00:02:18,460 --> 00:02:24,460
EPISODE 21: 10 AGAINST 11

18
00:02:19,830 --> 00:02:24,960
Captain El Sid Pierre will take the penalty.

19
00:02:25,840 --> 00:02:28,250
Soda, I'll catch it.

20
00:02:33,340 --> 00:02:34,630
Good, he shoots to the right.

21
00:02:38,480 --> 00:02:39,940
Goal!

22
00:02:39,940 --> 00:02:42,690
It goes right into the opposite corner from goalkeeper Wakashimazu.

23
00:02:42,690 --> 00:02:48,390
Pierre scores the penalty and France comfortably makes it 2-1.

24
00:02:48,570 --> 00:02:49,990
The score is turned around.

25
00:02:49,990 --> 00:02:52,870
Now all the French fans in the stadium are happy.

26
00:02:54,410 --> 00:02:59,400
You tricked the goalkeeper by signaling the direction of the shot.

27
00:03:01,540 --> 00:03:05,030
That's easy for a professional, right Pierre?

28
00:03:05,550 --> 00:03:08,670
Napoleon, you also received a warning.

29
00:03:08,760 --> 00:03:09,840
Don't forget that.

30
00:03:09,920 --> 00:03:11,420
I know.

31
00:03:12,260 --> 00:03:16,140
It's impossible for me to leave without scoring a goal.

32
00:03:16,220 --> 00:03:20,230
They will soon understand that I'm the number one forward.

33
00:03:20,690 --> 00:03:21,850
Damn it.

34
00:03:23,230 --> 00:03:27,810
It's not time to despair, we have to avenge Soda.

35
00:03:28,030 --> 00:03:29,310
Okay.

36
00:03:29,570 --> 00:03:34,910
As Hyuga-kun said, we have to fight for Soda-kun with 10 men.

37
00:03:35,830 --> 00:03:39,070
Japan restarts the game.

38
00:03:39,540 --> 00:03:40,820
Let's go.

39
00:03:41,120 --> 00:03:43,960
We owe you for what you did to us before the tournament.

40
00:03:44,040 --> 00:03:45,630
Crush him.

41
00:03:45,710 --> 00:03:46,580
Okay.

42
00:03:46,750 --> 00:03:49,120
The French come with hard tackles.

43
00:03:50,470 --> 00:03:52,680
But Misaki-kun gets past.

44
00:03:53,510 --> 00:03:57,460
I didn't know you were on the Japan team.

45
00:03:58,350 --> 00:03:59,210
Take this.

46
00:04:01,680 --> 00:04:04,720
Misaki-kun is down on the ground, is this a foul?

47
00:04:05,520 --> 00:04:07,860
No, the referee didn't call a foul.

48
00:04:07,940 --> 00:04:09,730
The ball goes to France.

49
00:04:10,320 --> 00:04:13,980
No foul? Are you kidding me?

50
00:04:15,200 --> 00:04:16,490
Let's advance, Tsubasa.

51
00:04:16,570 --> 00:04:17,490
Okay.

52
00:04:17,580 --> 00:04:20,500
The Japan team advances with Hyuga-kun and Tsubasa-kun,

53
00:04:20,580 --> 00:04:23,360
the duo that won the national cup on equal terms.

54
00:04:23,360 --> 00:04:24,860
Catch, Tsubasa!

55
00:04:25,580 --> 00:04:28,240
Oh, will Tsubasa-kun shoot?

56
00:04:28,240 --> 00:04:31,250
Defend! Don't let him shoot! Block his shot!

57
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:33,220
Tsubasa-kun passes!

58
00:04:33,300 --> 00:04:36,090
Instead of shooting from there, he passes back.

59
00:04:36,180 --> 00:04:38,510
To Misaki-kun in a great position.

60
00:04:38,600 --> 00:04:41,760
What magnificent harmony! They are truly the Golden Duo!

61
00:04:42,270 --> 00:04:44,010
Catch, Kojiro.

62
00:04:46,730 --> 00:04:51,440
Good, I'll score. Tiger Shot!

63
00:04:56,770 --> 00:05:00,660
Goal! Hyuga-kun's Tiger Shot explodes!

64
00:05:00,740 --> 00:05:03,580
Japan scores comfortably.

65
00:05:03,660 --> 00:05:05,580
Your shot was great, Hyuga-kun.

66
00:05:05,670 --> 00:05:06,780
Yes.

67
00:05:07,710 --> 00:05:13,170
What? No goal? The offside flag is up.

68
00:05:13,260 --> 00:05:16,920
And the referee accepted it and canceled the goal!

69
00:05:16,920 --> 00:05:19,760
What? Are you kidding?

70
00:05:19,850 --> 00:05:25,180
The defense moved after Misaki's pass. It wasn't offside.

71
00:05:25,810 --> 00:05:31,180
Hyuga-kun is busy protesting while France kicks off.

72
00:05:31,180 --> 00:05:33,060
Get back, guys!

73
00:05:33,650 --> 00:05:36,440
France is now 1 goal ahead of Japan.

74
00:05:36,610 --> 00:05:38,410
Be careful, Japan!

75
00:05:39,450 --> 00:05:41,160
Pierre advances.

76
00:05:41,240 --> 00:05:45,570
And sends a beautiful pass for Napoleon.

77
00:05:45,790 --> 00:05:47,370
Good, this is a goal.

78
00:05:47,460 --> 00:05:48,580
Don't let him shoot!

79
00:05:48,670 --> 00:05:50,290
Let it through, Napoleon!

80
00:05:51,340 --> 00:05:55,450
Napoleon didn't shoot, the ball goes between his legs.

81
00:05:55,470 --> 00:05:56,830
What?

82
00:05:57,050 --> 00:06:02,010
And France's second forward Bossi has moved to where Soda-kun was.

83
00:06:02,100 --> 00:06:03,090
Nice.

84
00:06:03,090 --> 00:06:06,590
Bossi shoots from close range.

85
00:06:09,810 --> 00:06:14,190
But goalkeeper Wakashimazu clears it.

86
00:06:14,280 --> 00:06:15,720
Great, Wakashimazu!

87
00:06:15,900 --> 00:06:19,730
But unfortunately, the ball rebounds toward Napoleon.

88
00:06:23,410 --> 00:06:28,210
This time it's a goal! Cannon Shot!

89
00:06:30,250 --> 00:06:32,290
Goal!

90
00:06:32,380 --> 00:06:35,960
The counterattack worked, the score is now 3-1.

91
00:06:36,050 --> 00:06:40,620
In the 20th minute of the first half, France takes a 2-goal lead.

92
00:06:40,970 --> 00:06:42,380
I scored my goal!

93
00:06:42,970 --> 00:06:44,010
No.

94
00:06:44,100 --> 00:06:45,260
It shouldn't be like this.

95
00:06:45,350 --> 00:06:48,760
They exploited the weakness of Japan's defense, one man short.

96
00:06:51,190 --> 00:06:54,150
Hang in there, guys.

97
00:06:54,510 --> 00:06:57,820
The stadium is roaring with the cheers of the home team.

98
00:06:57,900 --> 00:07:00,820
It turned into a huge beehive buzzing loudly.

99
00:07:00,910 --> 00:07:04,150
France's fierce attacks continue.

100
00:07:04,450 --> 00:07:06,160
Let's score one more goal in the first half.

101
00:07:06,240 --> 00:07:07,080
Yes!

102
00:07:07,160 --> 00:07:10,150
France's control tower, El Sid Pierre,

103
00:07:10,150 --> 00:07:13,040
skillfully exploits the gap left by Soda-kun's absence.

104
00:07:13,130 --> 00:07:14,660
D-Damn it.

105
00:07:15,500 --> 00:07:17,160
Run, Bossi!

106
00:07:17,160 --> 00:07:18,160
Okay.

107
00:07:18,160 --> 00:07:19,410
I won't allow it.

108
00:07:20,220 --> 00:07:25,390
Defensive midfielder Izawa-kun is trying hard to fill the gap left by Soda-kun.

109
00:07:26,060 --> 00:07:27,800
Great clearance, Izawa.

110
00:07:28,220 --> 00:07:29,640
I caught it.

111
00:07:30,020 --> 00:07:31,300
Damn it.

112
00:07:33,730 --> 00:07:38,610
Saved! Goalkeeper Wakashimazu made a great catch.

113
00:07:38,690 --> 00:07:40,070
Great, Wakashimazu.

114
00:07:40,150 --> 00:07:41,560
Damn it.

115
00:07:42,060 --> 00:07:44,410
Alright, go forward, guys.

116
00:07:44,530 --> 00:07:46,530
The first half shouldn't end like this.

117
00:07:46,620 --> 00:07:48,440
Get 1 goal back at all costs.

118
00:07:50,710 --> 00:07:51,750
Let's go, Sorimachi.

119
00:07:51,830 --> 00:07:52,700
Okay.

120
00:07:52,920 --> 00:07:55,710
Right, we'll get 1 goal back.

121
00:07:55,790 --> 00:07:58,170
Sorimachi-kun is following Hyuga-kun.

122
00:07:58,250 --> 00:08:00,200
They are Toho's two best forwards.

123
00:08:03,300 --> 00:08:07,090
He's not at an angle, but does he want to score from there?

124
00:08:07,350 --> 00:08:09,680
Catch, Misaki, shoot.

125
00:08:09,810 --> 00:08:11,590
Your pass was great, Kojiro.

126
00:08:11,930 --> 00:08:15,840
The final pass for Misaki-kun running in front of the goal.

127
00:08:15,840 --> 00:08:18,850
Misaki-kun jumps to head it.

128
00:08:20,280 --> 00:08:26,980
Blocked! Pierre is not only setting up play, but also marking Misaki in defense.

129
00:08:27,910 --> 00:08:29,690
The ball is separated.

130
00:08:31,700 --> 00:08:32,570
Great.

131
00:08:32,700 --> 00:08:38,540
Oh, Tsubasa-kun goes to make a return shot.

132
00:08:38,630 --> 00:08:39,950
No!

133
00:08:40,130 --> 00:08:42,170
C-Catch!

134
00:08:42,260 --> 00:08:43,210
Tsubasa-kun!

135
00:08:43,800 --> 00:08:47,210
Goal! This is not offside.

136
00:08:47,800 --> 00:08:49,810
Japan scores a very important goal.

137
00:08:49,890 --> 00:08:54,340
The gap is reduced to 1 toward the end of the first half.

138
00:08:54,340 --> 00:08:57,230
Hooray! You did it, you were great, Tsubasa!

139
00:08:57,310 --> 00:08:59,600
Just what's expected from you captain, your shot was great.

140
00:08:59,940 --> 00:09:02,490
Good job, guys, just one more goal.

141
00:09:02,570 --> 00:09:03,600
What?

142
00:09:04,110 --> 00:09:07,320
Oh, this is not a goal either.

143
00:09:07,410 --> 00:09:11,730
Tsubasa-kun's goal was canceled due to dangerous play by surrounding players.

144
00:09:11,950 --> 00:09:13,610
I-Impossible.

145
00:09:13,910 --> 00:09:17,240
Alright, hurry up, restart the game immediately.

146
00:09:17,420 --> 00:09:20,120
France restarts the game immediately.

147
00:09:20,380 --> 00:09:22,510
D-Damn it, get back!

148
00:09:22,750 --> 00:09:27,470
It's not fair, it should have been a tie.

149
00:09:28,010 --> 00:09:29,430
Damn it.

150
00:09:29,510 --> 00:09:34,010
The crowd seems to agree with the referee's decision not to award the goal.

151
00:09:34,010 --> 00:09:37,940
In the remaining little time of the first half,

152
00:09:38,020 --> 00:09:39,890
France goes to score the fourth goal.

153
00:09:39,890 --> 00:09:41,440
We must defend.

154
00:09:41,520 --> 00:09:43,740
If they score one more goal, everything will be over.

155
00:09:43,820 --> 00:09:45,530
Soda's absence created a deep gap.

156
00:09:45,610 --> 00:09:49,650
If the rest of us put in a little more effort...

157
00:09:49,910 --> 00:09:51,490
If we exert 10 percent more strength,

158
00:09:51,580 --> 00:09:53,370
we can fill the gap with 10 players.

159
00:09:53,450 --> 00:09:56,150
We can replace Soda with 10 players.

160
00:09:56,710 --> 00:09:59,710
I'm targeting the spot where that player was sent off earlier.

161
00:09:59,790 --> 00:10:02,250
This will definitely make us score one more goal.

162
00:10:03,960 --> 00:10:07,930
They are one defender short, so how...

163
00:10:08,130 --> 00:10:09,720
They didn't leave any room to infiltrate.

164
00:10:10,170 --> 00:10:11,680
Pierre, watch out!

165
00:10:12,290 --> 00:10:15,300
Misaki-kun, who is marking Pierre, makes a tackle.

166
00:10:15,930 --> 00:10:19,050
But Pierre jumps and gets past him.

167
00:10:19,050 --> 00:10:23,270
Oh, but Tsubasa-kun also jumps where Pierre jumped.

168
00:10:23,360 --> 00:10:24,810
I won't be fooled twice by the same trick.

169
00:10:28,990 --> 00:10:32,870
Tsubasa-kun reads his pass and blocks it with a return move.

170
00:10:32,950 --> 00:10:33,820
What?

171
00:10:36,160 --> 00:10:37,210
Bring it on.

172
00:10:37,290 --> 00:10:39,870
Tsubasa-kun is still furious because of the canceled goal.

173
00:10:39,960 --> 00:10:42,290
He dribbles with anger.

174
00:10:42,630 --> 00:10:43,630
Tsubasa.

175
00:10:44,420 --> 00:10:45,920
Good, come on, Tsubasa.

176
00:10:46,010 --> 00:10:47,380
Tsubasa-senpai.

177
00:10:47,470 --> 00:10:48,760
Tsubasa-kun.

178
00:10:55,850 --> 00:10:58,390
And he bursts through.

179
00:10:58,480 --> 00:11:03,100
No one from the France team can stop Tsubasa-kun's fast dribble.

180
00:11:03,440 --> 00:11:08,030
Tsubasa-kun passes 8 players, tying him with Diaz-kun.

181
00:11:08,110 --> 00:11:08,980
What?

182
00:11:09,490 --> 00:11:12,980
Draw a straight line from Japan's goal to France's goal.

183
00:11:13,370 --> 00:11:18,830
It's not just my dribbling, Misaki-kun and Hyuga-kun are also behind me.

184
00:11:18,910 --> 00:11:22,040
That's why I can dribble without worry.

185
00:11:22,130 --> 00:11:25,250
I have to score this to have a chance in the second half!

186
00:11:25,740 --> 00:11:28,120
This is one-on-one with the goalkeeper.

187
00:11:28,460 --> 00:11:30,840
And this is also for Soda-kun.

188
00:11:33,970 --> 00:11:36,890
Goal! Incredible!

189
00:11:36,970 --> 00:11:41,890
Meet Ozora Tsubasa, Japan's phenomenon footballer!

190
00:11:41,350 --> 00:11:43,350
CAPTAIN TSUBASA: JUNIOR YOUTH ARC

191
00:11:41,980 --> 00:11:42,980
Good.

192
00:11:47,920 --> 00:11:50,020
Born: July 28 | Height: 167 cm | Weight: 55 kg | Blood Type: AB

193
00:11:50,510 --> 00:11:53,420
Goal! Incredible!

194
00:11:53,510 --> 00:11:58,350
Meet Ozora Tsubasa-kun, Japan's phenomenon footballer.

195
00:11:58,430 --> 00:11:59,430
Good.

196
00:12:01,350 --> 00:12:05,770
Oh, the referee didn't accept it again.

197
00:12:05,850 --> 00:12:07,270
The first half comes to an end.

198
00:12:07,440 --> 00:12:09,290
What?

199
00:12:09,290 --> 00:12:13,440
It seems the referee blew the end of the first half before Tsubasa's goal.

200
00:12:13,530 --> 00:12:15,780
N-Not a goal again.

201
00:12:15,860 --> 00:12:17,280
Not a goal?

202
00:12:19,800 --> 00:12:21,290
Ozora's house

203
00:12:21,580 --> 00:12:24,460
What? What's going on?

204
00:12:24,910 --> 00:12:26,870
I can't watch anymore.

205
00:12:27,080 --> 00:12:29,590
Tsubasa-kun doesn't give up.

206
00:12:29,710 --> 00:12:33,510
Then let's do the same and support them until the end.

207
00:12:33,590 --> 00:12:35,470
Nakazawa-senpai.

208
00:12:41,680 --> 00:12:44,890
G-Guys, what happened to the match?

209
00:12:45,350 --> 00:12:48,580
It's 3-1, they are two goals ahead.

210
00:12:49,270 --> 00:12:50,770
I see.

211
00:12:51,320 --> 00:12:53,960
This... this is my fault.

212
00:12:55,650 --> 00:12:57,950
Damn it, that referee!

213
00:12:58,030 --> 00:12:59,200
Calm down, Hyuga.

214
00:12:59,410 --> 00:13:03,620
But 3 times! He refused 3 times! He canceled every goal.

215
00:13:03,830 --> 00:13:06,830
We should have been one goal ahead right now.

216
00:13:06,840 --> 00:13:09,130
Right, that referee...

217
00:13:09,210 --> 00:13:13,300
If we lose this match, I'll go and beat him up real good...

218
00:13:13,380 --> 00:13:14,230
Jito.

219
00:13:18,130 --> 00:13:21,050
Let's save this anger for the match.

220
00:13:21,680 --> 00:13:23,060
Tsubasa.

221
00:13:23,180 --> 00:13:26,980
Soda also wants to vent his anger, but he has no way right now.

222
00:13:27,190 --> 00:13:28,700
Y-Yes.

223
00:13:29,600 --> 00:13:30,830
Tsubasa.

224
00:13:31,650 --> 00:13:33,690
Because of Soda's second warning,

225
00:13:33,780 --> 00:13:36,570
I will file an official complaint on behalf of the team after the match.

226
00:13:36,820 --> 00:13:39,570
The mistake must be corrected.

227
00:13:39,740 --> 00:13:43,340
For now, keep your faith and fight. I trust all 10 of you.

228
00:13:43,660 --> 00:13:44,950
Coach.

229
00:13:46,080 --> 00:13:51,330
Alright, we'll score and equalize in the second half.

230
00:13:51,420 --> 00:13:53,340
And then we'll win!

231
00:13:53,350 --> 00:13:55,340
- Yes!
- Right!

232
00:13:55,760 --> 00:13:59,630
Soda, you can vent your anger in the final.

233
00:13:59,720 --> 00:14:02,720
We'll make sure that happens.

234
00:14:02,800 --> 00:14:04,110
Guys.

235
00:14:04,640 --> 00:14:07,930
Alright, don't let being 2 goals ahead make you arrogant.

236
00:14:08,100 --> 00:14:12,110
The referee helped more than we wanted.

237
00:14:12,440 --> 00:14:13,310
Yes.

238
00:14:13,400 --> 00:14:15,110
I know, Pierre.

239
00:14:15,480 --> 00:14:17,990
We can't underestimate Japan.

240
00:14:18,740 --> 00:14:20,380
Especially that number 10.

241
00:14:20,660 --> 00:14:24,910
Yes, number 10's dribbles were incredible.

242
00:14:25,450 --> 00:14:29,000
We will use the offside trap in the second half with our defense.

243
00:14:29,080 --> 00:14:32,380
Then we'll target a three-goal difference.

244
00:14:32,580 --> 00:14:35,770
We'll show them the true meaning of French football.

245
00:14:36,130 --> 00:14:37,340
Okay.

246
00:14:39,220 --> 00:14:41,970
What do you think, Schneider, after the first half?

247
00:14:42,390 --> 00:14:46,850
If Wakabayashi plays in the second half, Japan will definitely win.

248
00:14:47,560 --> 00:14:51,020
Just like me, he passed 8 players, admirable.

249
00:14:51,100 --> 00:14:53,770
But Japan still might not win.

250
00:14:53,900 --> 00:14:56,770
Yes, the host decides that.

251
00:14:56,860 --> 00:15:00,570
France is definitely at an advantage at home.

252
00:15:02,070 --> 00:15:05,030
Rain has started at the stadium.

253
00:15:05,120 --> 00:15:08,550
It looks like the second half will be rainy.

254
00:15:08,830 --> 00:15:10,080
Rain.

255
00:15:10,160 --> 00:15:12,790
This is just like the final three years ago.

256
00:15:12,870 --> 00:15:15,590
I hope it clouds over and stops soon.

257
00:15:15,920 --> 00:15:16,750
Yes.

258
00:15:16,920 --> 00:15:20,920
No, I don't think this rain will stop anytime soon.

259
00:15:22,840 --> 00:15:24,800
A rainy semifinal.

260
00:15:25,680 --> 00:15:27,560
So are you going to let it end like this?

261
00:15:27,890 --> 00:15:31,390
Didn't you intend to come with me to Brazil?

262
00:15:33,600 --> 00:15:40,570
At that time, Tsubasa was mentally and physically broken apart.

263
00:15:41,030 --> 00:15:46,200
But he pulled himself together and won.

264
00:15:47,200 --> 00:15:48,830
I see this rain as luck.

265
00:15:50,790 --> 00:15:52,540
A rainy semifinal.

266
00:15:53,580 --> 00:15:59,340
That match with Tsubasa-kun made me continue my football passion.

267
00:15:59,880 --> 00:16:03,300
It was going to be my first and last tournament.

268
00:16:06,510 --> 00:16:10,930
Coach, I'm ready at any moment, not just for the last 10 minutes.

269
00:16:11,100 --> 00:16:13,060
Put me in the game whenever you want.

270
00:16:13,180 --> 00:16:14,310
Coach.

271
00:16:14,640 --> 00:16:17,690
Yes, we are no longer injured.

272
00:16:17,770 --> 00:16:20,980
We will score again with the Space Storm.

273
00:16:21,110 --> 00:16:23,110
Okay, I understand.

274
00:16:26,070 --> 00:16:31,510
Genzo, you may be someone who really wants to play right now.

275
00:16:31,830 --> 00:16:37,460
You decided to play the bad guy role to strengthen the Japan team.

276
00:16:38,880 --> 00:16:43,510
Moreover, you didn't even have the chance to train with them.

277
00:16:43,920 --> 00:16:49,970
Forgive me, I'm sorry I can't play here right now, Genzo.

278
00:16:51,850 --> 00:16:54,520
If there is a God, please.

279
00:16:54,810 --> 00:16:57,810
Please let Japan win, I beg you.

280
00:16:58,480 --> 00:17:02,030
The second half begins with Japan's kickoff.

281
00:17:03,070 --> 00:17:03,940
Get ready.

282
00:17:04,030 --> 00:17:10,780
Our anger, our joy, our dream, our spirit, our friendship, all our efforts...

283
00:17:11,080 --> 00:17:13,200
We put all our hopes for victory into this ball.

284
00:17:14,160 --> 00:17:15,500
Let's advance, Misaki-kun.

285
00:17:15,680 --> 00:17:17,250
Okay, Tsubasa-kun.

286
00:17:17,960 --> 00:17:20,960
Japan once again attacks with the Golden Duo,

287
00:17:21,090 --> 00:17:24,170
Ozora Tsubasa and Taro Misaki.

288
00:17:24,420 --> 00:17:28,930
We put all our spirit and passion into this ball and fight strongly.

289
00:17:29,840 --> 00:17:34,680
And now, a beautiful combination play from Japan's Golden Duo.

290
00:17:34,700 --> 00:17:37,940
If I could read the pass, I could catch it.

291
00:17:38,730 --> 00:17:40,480
Good, right there.

292
00:17:41,540 --> 00:17:42,980
How artistic!

293
00:17:43,070 --> 00:17:46,360
He fakes a pass and gets past with a dribble.

294
00:17:46,440 --> 00:17:47,820
Great, Tsubasa-kun.

295
00:17:48,820 --> 00:17:49,950
Pierre.

296
00:17:50,030 --> 00:17:53,280
Oh, but Misaki-kun fell into Pierre's trap.

297
00:17:53,370 --> 00:17:55,080
He can't get past him.

298
00:17:55,240 --> 00:17:58,460
But Hyuga-kun is currently unmarked.

299
00:17:58,470 --> 00:17:59,460
Catch.

300
00:17:59,470 --> 00:18:02,250
He prevents Misaki-kun from making a combination play.

301
00:18:02,260 --> 00:18:04,960
He crosses forward.

302
00:18:05,420 --> 00:18:08,130
It reaches Hyuga-kun very cleanly.

303
00:18:08,220 --> 00:18:11,470
In front of the goal and unmarked.

304
00:18:11,550 --> 00:18:12,550
Good.

305
00:18:13,180 --> 00:18:16,490
Oh, but this is offside.

306
00:18:19,270 --> 00:18:20,230
What?

307
00:18:20,310 --> 00:18:21,780
What happened?

308
00:18:22,060 --> 00:18:23,730
Offside trap!

309
00:18:24,190 --> 00:18:28,030
All the defenders pushed forward with Tsubasa's pass.

310
00:18:28,110 --> 00:18:31,880
This is an offside trap, Misugi's team Musashi was really good at this.

311
00:18:34,410 --> 00:18:37,000
France's turn to counterattack.

312
00:18:37,160 --> 00:18:38,160
Stop them!

313
00:18:38,250 --> 00:18:40,620
We can't allow them to score anymore.

314
00:18:41,170 --> 00:18:43,680
Japan's defense gained morale.

315
00:18:43,680 --> 00:18:46,270
But there is always a chance to score.

316
00:18:47,340 --> 00:18:48,630
I'll take Napoleon.

317
00:18:48,720 --> 00:18:51,430
I, Mamoru Izawa, will do this in Soda's place.

318
00:18:52,270 --> 00:18:53,300
Then...

319
00:18:53,550 --> 00:18:54,940
Run, Bossi.

320
00:18:55,180 --> 00:18:56,100
Okay.

321
00:18:56,180 --> 00:19:00,100
Now a deep pass is sent between the defense.

322
00:19:00,180 --> 00:19:02,810
A skillful pass from Pierre.

323
00:19:02,900 --> 00:19:05,540
I'm also a forward of the France team.

324
00:19:05,690 --> 00:19:07,280
I must and will score this goal.

325
00:19:09,210 --> 00:19:10,280
- No!
- No!

326
00:19:14,160 --> 00:19:18,790
Goalkeeper Wakashimazu saves with a dive.

327
00:19:19,170 --> 00:19:25,590
Alright, it's our turn, score, guys!

328
00:19:27,880 --> 00:19:28,800
Nice.

329
00:19:29,170 --> 00:19:31,130
Acrobatic player Mitsuru Sano-kun,

330
00:19:31,220 --> 00:19:34,050
skillfully takes the ball and advances to midfield alone.

331
00:19:34,220 --> 00:19:36,100
Catch, here it comes!

332
00:19:37,310 --> 00:19:38,560
Come on!

333
00:19:38,640 --> 00:19:40,560
Sano-kun passes.

334
00:19:41,390 --> 00:19:43,310
It reaches captain Tsubasa-kun.

335
00:19:43,810 --> 00:19:46,020
Alright, once again, Misaki-kun.

336
00:19:46,110 --> 00:19:46,940
Okay.

337
00:19:47,110 --> 00:19:49,780
Come on, Tsubasa, Misaki.

338
00:19:49,860 --> 00:19:51,440
Tsubasa-senpai.

339
00:19:51,530 --> 00:19:53,450
Good luck, Tsubasa-kun.

340
00:19:54,740 --> 00:19:55,700
Misaki-kun.

341
00:19:58,200 --> 00:19:59,200
Pierre!

342
00:19:59,910 --> 00:20:03,250
Right, if I can get past Pierre alone,

343
00:20:03,330 --> 00:20:05,710
then we increase our chance of a goal.

344
00:20:05,920 --> 00:20:09,960
Misaki-kun faces Pierre alone.

345
00:20:10,050 --> 00:20:10,960
Misaki.

346
00:20:11,050 --> 00:20:12,090
Misaki-kun!

347
00:20:15,590 --> 00:20:17,100
Technique against technique.

348
00:20:17,430 --> 00:20:19,720
This is a clash of two talents.

349
00:20:20,260 --> 00:20:21,970
Who will win?

350
00:20:22,430 --> 00:20:24,350
Will he get past? Or will he be defended?

351
00:20:24,390 --> 00:20:27,490
Who will win, Japan or France?

352
00:20:30,190 --> 00:20:33,150
The victory song goes toward France.

353
00:20:33,240 --> 00:20:36,490
Pierre makes a skillful tackle.

354
00:20:36,820 --> 00:20:38,830
Sorry, guys.

355
00:20:39,280 --> 00:20:41,370
Not over yet.

356
00:20:41,580 --> 00:20:43,710
Football is not an individual sport.

357
00:20:43,790 --> 00:20:45,890
We play it by helping each other.

358
00:20:46,330 --> 00:20:47,330
Catch.

359
00:20:47,420 --> 00:20:49,130
- What?
- Sorimachi.

360
00:20:49,380 --> 00:20:52,050
The ball goes toward Tsubasa-kun heading to the goal.

361
00:20:52,130 --> 00:20:53,130
Sorimachi.

362
00:20:53,140 --> 00:20:54,470
I won't let him score.

363
00:20:54,550 --> 00:20:55,650
Don't let him shoot.

364
00:20:55,840 --> 00:20:58,590
We finally got an opportunity and I don't want to waste it.

365
00:20:58,680 --> 00:21:01,140
The situation may not be great, but I have to shoot.

366
00:21:01,150 --> 00:21:02,640
I have no other choice.

367
00:21:02,850 --> 00:21:04,020
He will shoot!

368
00:21:04,100 --> 00:21:05,270
Block his shot!

369
00:21:06,440 --> 00:21:07,900
What?

370
00:21:08,810 --> 00:21:13,400
Tsubasa-kun passes back.

371
00:21:13,900 --> 00:21:15,360
Shoot, Hyuga-kun!

372
00:21:15,860 --> 00:21:16,920
Damn it.

373
00:21:16,920 --> 00:21:19,910
Hyuga-kun is coming fast.

374
00:21:21,910 --> 00:21:24,830
Now no one can find fault here.

375
00:21:24,910 --> 00:21:26,180
I won't let you shoot.

376
00:21:26,370 --> 00:21:29,920
Please Hyuga, our heart and soul are in that ball, you must score!

377
00:21:30,170 --> 00:21:34,460
Get ready! All the anger of the Japan team...

378
00:21:36,010 --> 00:21:40,180
I've loaded it into my Tiger Shot!

379
00:21:47,850 --> 00:21:51,360
Hyuga-kun's Tiger Shot is a goal!

380
00:21:51,440 --> 00:21:52,730
Score 3-2!

381
00:21:52,820 --> 00:21:57,170
In the 7th minute of the second half, Japan scores a goal.

382
00:21:57,170 --> 00:21:59,200
Great shot, Hyuga.

383
00:21:59,280 --> 00:22:01,700
You were great, Hyuga-kun.

384
00:22:02,490 --> 00:22:06,540
Did you see? That's the goal.

385
00:23:46,760 --> 00:24:49,990
NEXT EPISODE: THE ELEGANT MONSTER ATTACKS